# Direct miter: (s + c) == a*b at the real 24x24 width.
#
# THIS DOES NOT CONVERGE. Recorded so nobody re-derives it: killed after
# 10 minutes still "Solving problem with 35709 variables and 98457 clauses".
# Multiplier equivalence is a known hard case for SAT and the project already
# hit the same wall on titan_apex_mult_seg (docs/BUILD_LOG_2NM.md, "Where
# formal beat simulation"). Same remedy applies -- prove_csa_parts.ys for the
# tractable decomposition, tb/tb_csa_mul.v for full width by simulation.
read_verilog rtl/common/titan_x7_csa_mul.v syn/gt2n/prove_csa_mul.v
hierarchy -top csa_mul_equiv
proc; opt -full; flatten; opt -full
sat -verify -prove diff 1'b0 csa_mul_equiv
